{"id":34,"name":"nidoking","speciesId":34,"dex":34,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["poison","ground"],"stats":{"hp":81,"attack":102,"defense":77,"special-attack":85,"special-defense":75,"speed":85},"abilities":[{"name":"poison-point","hidden":false},{"name":"rivalry","hidden":false},{"name":"sheer-force","hidden":true}],"height":14,"weight":620,"baseExp":227,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/34.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/34.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/34.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/34.ogg","genus":"Drill Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"red","text":"It uses its powerful tail in battle to smash, constrict, then break the prey's bones."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Its steel-like hide adds to its powerful tackle. Its horns are so hard, they can pierce a diamond."},{"version":"gold","text":"It swings its big tail around during battle. If its foe flinches, it will charge with its sturdy body."},{"version":"silver","text":"Its tail is thick and powerful. If it binds an enemy, it can snap the victim's spine quite easily."},{"version":"crystal","text":"It uses its thick arms, legs and tail to attack forcefully. Melee combat is its specialty."},{"version":"ruby","text":"NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power. With one swing, it can topple a metal transmission tower. Once this POKéMON goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"version":"emerald","text":"A NIDOKING’s thick tail packs enormously destructive power capable of toppling a metal transmission tower. Once it goes on a rampage, there is no stopping it."},{"version":"firered","text":"It is recognized by its rock-hard hide and its extended horn. Be careful with the horn as it contains venom."},{"version":"le